{"id":"tuido-6e287f","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Toggle to hide suspended todos (unify view filters)","description":"Follow-up from tuido-ae3d6f, where suspended todos got a distinct style. A key to hide suspended todos, like `h` does for completed ones, was deliberately left out of scope there.\n\nIf this is built, don't add a second bool next to `App::hide_completed`. Replace it with a single view-filter type used by `is_visible`, `visible_indices`, `fix_selection` and the list title (for example `struct ViewFilter { completed: bool, suspended: bool }` or a cycling enum), so adding filters doesn't spread special cases.\n\nLow priority: nothing on the roadmap depends on it.","priority":4,"sort_order":"a5","dependencies":[{"source_id":"tuido-6e287f","target_id":"tuido-ae3d6f","kind":"relates_to"}],"labels":["feature","ux"]},"created_at":"2026-10-02T13:19:37.041513Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.287 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
